	   THE COMPLAINT: the boundary between this page's last section and the footer, "die kleuren gaan gewoon
	   niet samen", and explicitly NOT to be solved with a fade.
	   MEASURED at the foot of the page: the closing field ran hue 25–32° at S 0.27–0.43 (a desaturated
